1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:01,710
Minato!!

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:03,920
Are you okay?!

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:06,090
Stay with me, Minato!

4
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:13,350
I'm sorry!

5
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,730
What happened?!

6
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:17,810
I'm so sorry.

7
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:19,600
I was right there with him, but...

8
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,770
I'm asking Minato.

9
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:25,110
I'm sorry!

10
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:27,690
I accidentally lost
something very important.

11
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:29,490
Well...

12
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,120
I just panicked.

13
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,870
And so...

14
00:00:33,870 --> 00:00:34,910
And then what?

15
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:36,750
Nothing...

16
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:37,790
Even so...

17
00:00:37,790 --> 00:00:39,790
So what actually happened?

18
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:42,130
Don't blame him like that.

19
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:43,750
Anyone would panic in that situation.

20
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:46,210
At a critical time like this,

21
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:49,260
is there anything
more important than your health?!

22
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:53,510
Be more responsible!

23
00:00:55,890 --> 00:00:58,810
The lead and the heroine,

24
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,520
at such a crucial time...

25
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:04,480
What are you thinking?!

26
00:01:12,360 --> 00:01:15,370
I really can't do this after all...

27
00:01:15,910 --> 00:01:16,580
What?

28
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:17,700
Wait...!
